##RenderMan RIB-Structure 1.0
# Spec 026 Situations scene (tests/shading_contract): row 1: a REYES grid seen by the camera, camerahitmode "primitive" (applied after the shaders, oddity 1)
version 3.03
Hider "hidden"
Option "shaderformat" "default" ["rslo"]
Option "sampling" "sampler" ["sobol"]
Option "sampling" "seed" [1]
Option "limits" "numthreads" [1]
PixelSamples 1 1
Format 8 8 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" 30
Clipping 0.1 100
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
  Attribute "shade" "string camerahitmode" ["primitive"]
  AttributeBegin
    Surface "sit_marker"
    Sphere 1 -1 1 360
  AttributeEnd
WorldEnd
